#
# CCIC devices
#

comment "CCIC configs"

config MAX77958
	tristate "Analog Devices MAX77958 USBC/PD Support"
	depends on I2C
	help
	  Say yes here to add support for Analog Devices MAX77958.
	  This is a USB Type-C CC detection and PD protocol controller.
	  This driver provides I2C communication, IRQ handling, and
	  firmware update support for the device.

config MAX77958_DEBUG
	tristate "Analog Devices MAX77958 Debug Interface"
	depends on MAX77958
	help
	  Say yes here to add support for Analog Devices MAX77958 Debug.
	  This shows debug message for USB Type-C CC detection and
	  PD protocol implementation. It also enables additional I2C
	  bulk transfer logging for debugging communication issues.

